## 9. Acceptance criteria
- [ ] A dry run matches the report owner's next round and sends nothing.
- [ ] A run date gets one email with no duplicate recipients and the page link only.
- [ ] A run with no findings sends no email.
- [ ] An unresolved recipient goes on the exception list. The list is not guessed.
- [ ] A failed send writes no record. A retry for a recorded run date sends nothing.
- [ ] Slice 2 writes nothing to Jira.
